# A on Oputa's control towers (ObjID $38 at 41,27 and 55,27, index 2):
# ObjType_Events 2, loc_DA80 (ps2.asm:20026), "This is the control tower
# which links the town and Mother Brain in one network." ($1709). Before
# build 69: "There seems to be nothing unusual here." ($1708) and "event
# $02 is not ported" on stderr. Paseo's four, Zema's, Kueri's two and
# Piata's five towers are the same object.

start level 6 41 29          # Oputa, below the west tower
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 1                    # 41,28, facing the tower's event at 41,27
wait step
expect level 6 41 28
press a
wait idle
expect script $1709
shot 01_west_tower
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect level 6 41 28         # the box closed, the pad back
expect no-stderr not ported
